# Core

- Prefer minimal diffs; do not refactor unrelated code or configs.
- Follow existing conventions in the touched area; read neighboring `*.keymap`, `*.conf`, overlays, and shield files before editing.
- Treat `build.yaml` as the authoritative CI matrix when suggesting board/shield/cmake-args combinations.
- Do not add dependencies or toolchain assumptions without an explicit request or clear project pattern.
- Do not commit secrets, tokens, or `.env` contents.
